                    <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                </button>
                <div id="answer1" class="answer">
                    Commission is calculated as a percentage of the total order value (excluding shipping and taxes). For example, a $100 order with a 5% commission would incur a $5 fee. Internal vendors pay <strong>0% commission</strong> on every successful order.
                </div>
